    networking: manage network availability
    
    Add administrator availability controls with current capability metadata and
    show disabled owned addresses without assignment actions. Available selectors
    request the optional enabled-network filter and revalidate cached results.
    
    Keep unknown state and unsupported fields compatible with older APIs. Record
    REQ-071 and the REQ-050 extension with scoped API and workflow documentation,
    synthetic unit coverage and prepared bilingual browser scenarios.
